#: includes/Main.php:42
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen"

#: includes/Settings.php:32
msgid "Autoshare Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen › Autoshare"

#: includes/Settings.php:36
msgid "RRZE-Autoshare"
msgstr "RRZE-Autoshare"

#: includes/Options/BlueskyAuthorize.php:28
msgid "Username or email address"
msgstr "Benutzername oder E-Mail-Adresse"

#: includes/Options/BlueskyAuthorize.php:34
msgid "Bluesky App Password"
msgstr "Bluesky-App-Passwort"

#: includes/Options/BlueskyAuthorize.php:42
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Create a separate <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Bluesky App Password</a>. Do not enter the Bluesky account "
"password. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Learn more about App Passwords</a>. The entered data is used "
"only once for authorization and is not saved."
msgstr ""
"Erstellen Sie ein separates <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Bluesky-App-Passwort</a>. Geben Sie nicht das Passwort Ihres "
"Bluesky-Kontos ein. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Mehr über App-Passwörter erfahren</a>. Die eingegebenen Daten "
"werden nur einmal für die Autorisierung verwendet und nicht gespeichert."

#: includes/Options/BlueskyAuthorize.php:59
#: includes/Services/Bluesky/API.php:395 includes/Services/Mastodon/API.php:365
msgid "Authorize Access"
msgstr "Zugriff autorisieren"

#: includes/Options/BlueskyAuthorize.php:74
msgid "Bluesky access was authorized."
msgstr "Der Zugriff auf Bluesky wurde autorisiert."

#: includes/Options/BlueskyAuthorize.php:76
msgid ""
"Bluesky access could not be authorized. Check the account identifier and App "
"Password."
msgstr ""
"Der Zugriff auf Bluesky konnte nicht autorisiert werden. Prüfen Sie die "
"Konto-Kennung und das App-Passwort."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/API.php:27 includes/Services/Bluesky/API.php:47
#: includes/Settings/Settings.php:267
msgid "You do not have enough permissions to do that."
msgstr "Dazu haben Sie nicht genügend Berechtigungen."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/API.php:52
msgid "The link you followed has expired. Please try again."
msgstr "Der aufgerufene Link ist abgelaufen. Bitte versuchen Sie es erneut."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/API.php:352 includes/Services/Mastodon/API.php:322
msgid "An error occurred while trying to publish."
msgstr "Beim Versuch der Veröffentlichung ist ein Fehler aufgetreten."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/API.php:371 includes/Services/Mastodon/API.php:341
#, php-format
msgid "Error: %d. "
msgstr "Fehler: %d. "

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/API.php:381
msgid "This post was not published on Bluesky."
msgstr "Dieser Beitrag wurde nicht auf Bluesky veröffentlicht."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/API.php:394 includes/Services/Mastodon/API.php:364
msgid "Revoke Access"
msgstr "Zugriff widerrufen"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/API.php:400
msgid "You’ve authorized Autoshare to read and write to the Bluesky timeline."
msgstr ""
"Sie haben Autoshare autorisiert, die Bluesky-Timeline zu lesen und zu "
"schreiben."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/API.php:401
msgid "Authorize Autoshare to read and write to the Bluesky timeline."
msgstr ""
"Autorisieren Sie Autoshare zum Lesen und Schreiben in die Bluesky-Timeline."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:16
msgid "Bluesky"
msgstr "Bluesky"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:19
msgid "Bluesky Settings"
msgstr "Bluesky Einstellungen"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:21
msgid ""
"Bluesky, also known as Bluesky Social, is a social microblogging platform."
"<br>Please complete the settings fields so that Autoshare can read and write "
"to the Bluesky timeline."
msgstr ""
"Bluesky, auch bekannt als Bluesky Social, ist eine soziale Microblogging-"
"Plattform.<br>Bitte füllen Sie die Einstellungsfelder aus, damit Autoshare "
"die Bluesky-Timeline lesen und schreiben kann."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:27
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:27
msgid "Service URL"
msgstr "Dienst-URL"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:28
msgid "The URL of the Bluesky service."
msgstr "Die URL des Bluesky-Dienstes."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:36
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:35
msgid "The URL entered is not valid."
msgstr "Die eingegebene URL ist ungültig."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:40
msgid "The Bluesky service URL cannot be changed."
msgstr "Die Bluesky-Service-URL kann nicht geändert werden."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:47
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:51
msgid "Content Types"
msgstr "Inhaltstypen"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:48
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:52
msgid "Select the type of content that Autoshare could use."
msgstr "Wählen Sie die Art von Inhalten aus, die Autoshare verwenden könnte."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:54
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:58
msgid "Enable by default"
msgstr "Standardmäßig aktivieren"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:55
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:59
msgid "Enable Autoshare by default when publishing content"
msgstr "Standardmäßig Autoshare aktivieren beim Veröffentlichen von Inhalten"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:60
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:64
msgid "Featured Images"
msgstr "Beitragsbild"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:61
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:65
msgid "Include featured images"
msgstr "Beitragsbild hinzufügen"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:67
#, php-format
msgid "Accepted content type: %1$s. Maximum post length: %2$d characters."
msgstr "Akzeptierter Inhaltstyp: %1$s. Maximale Beitragslänge: %2$d Zeichen."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:68
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:72
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Text"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:72
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:76
msgid "Post Format"
msgstr "Beitragsformat"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:79
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:83
msgid "Format"
msgstr "Format"

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:80
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:84
msgid ""
"Use the placeholders {title}, {excerpt}, {url}, and {tags}. All placeholders "
"are required. Empty lines are removed automatically."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie die Platzhalter {title}, {excerpt}, {url} und {tags}. Alle "
"Platzhalter sind erforderlich. Leere Zeilen werden automatisch entfernt."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:87
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:91
msgid "The format must contain {title}, {excerpt}, {url}, and {tags}."
msgstr "Das Format muss {title}, {excerpt}, {url} und {tags} enthalten."

#: includes/Services/Bluesky/Settings.php:94
#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:98
msgid "Access"
msgstr "Zugriff"

#: includes/Services/Mastodon/API.php:351
msgid "This post was not published on Mastodon."
msgstr "Dieser Beitrag wurde nicht auf Mastodon veröffentlicht."

#: includes/Services/Mastodon/API.php:370
msgid "You’ve authorized Autoshare to read and write to the Mastodon timeline."
msgstr ""
"Sie haben Autoshare autorisiert, die Mastodon-Timeline zu lesen und zu "
"schreiben."

#: includes/Services/Mastodon/API.php:371
msgid "Authorize Autoshare to read and write to the Mastodon timeline."
msgstr ""
"Autorisieren Sie Autoshare zum Lesen und Schreiben in die Mastodon-Timeline."

#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:16
msgid "Mastodon"
msgstr "Mastodon"

#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:19
msgid "Mastodon Settings"
msgstr "Mastodon Einstellungen"

#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:21
msgid ""
"Mastodon is a free social networking service with microblogging features."
"<br>Please complete the settings fields so that Autoshare can read and write "
"to the Mastodon timeline."
msgstr ""
"Mastodon ist ein freier sozialer Netzwerkdienst mit Microblogging-Funktionen."
"<br>Bitte fuellen Sie die Einstellungsfelder aus, damit Autoshare die "
"Mastodon-Timeline lesen und bearbeiten kann."

#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:28
msgid "The URL of the Mastodon service."
msgstr "Die URL des Mastodon-Dienstes."

#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:42
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Benutzername"

#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:43
msgid "The Mastodon account username."
msgstr "Der Benutzername des Mastodon-Kontos."

#: includes/Services/Mastodon/Settings.php:71
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Accepted content type: %1$s. Maximum post length: %2$d characters. The "
"actual limit can differ depending on the Mastodon instance."
msgstr ""
"Akzeptierter Inhaltstyp: %1$s. Maximale Beitragslänge: %2$d Zeichen. Das "
"tatsächliche Limit kann je nach Mastodon-Instanz abweichen."

